Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.70,0:00:05.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,70)\fad(180,220)\fnRoundHog SemiBold\fs32\c&H001CCEFF}Justin D'Souza (Asymptote Labs)
Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.70,0:00:05.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,132)\fad(180,220)}“The value is in
Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.70,0:00:05.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,196)\fad(180,220)}remediation, not
Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.70,0:00:05.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,260)\fad(180,220)}detection”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think where the value
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:02.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,accrues is really just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:03.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,around remediation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.43,0:00:05.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,So it's not really any
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.55,0:00:07.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,more around detection.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:08.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's also true that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:09.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,there's more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.02,0:00:10.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,vulnerabilities than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:11.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,ever before like they're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:12.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,kind of exponentially
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:13.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,growing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.07,0:00:13.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's cheaper than ever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.97,0:00:15.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,to have, Claude Code as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:17.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,a security reviewer or
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:18.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,to use, an open model as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.22,0:00:19.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,a security reviewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.59,0:00:20.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,But I think it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.33,0:00:21.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,inevitable that there's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.05,0:00:21.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,always going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.89,0:00:22.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,vulnerabilities that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.66,0:00:23.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,whether they're low
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:24.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,severity or high
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:24.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,severity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.30,0:00:26.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,get merged in at some
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:27.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,point and deployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.70,0:00:28.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,And so for every
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:29.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,enterprise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:30.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think it's a lot more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:31.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,about investing in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:32.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,infrastructure to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.84,0:00:34.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,remediate a lot faster.
